WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The path through the mountains is very dangerous!

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
One wrong step - and that's it!

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
If you don't fall into the abyss, the wind will throw you off, or an avalanche will sweep you away.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
But that won't stop us, will it?
